# 1. X register increment (ALWAYS performed):
#    - regs.currentRegisters.X = (ushort)(regs.currentRegisters.X + 1)
#
# 2. Condition evaluation (after increment):
#    - condition = ((regs.currentRegisters.X & (1 << 15)) == 0)
#    - Tests bit 15 of X register (sign bit)
#
# 3. Two-step operation:
#    - Step 1: X ← X + 1 (always executed)
#    - Step 2: if (X[15] == 0) then jump (positive or zero)
#
# 4. Conditional jump logic (CJP helper):
